{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Peter's Job Interview"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Getting Ready for the Interview"}, {"type": "position", "content": 5}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 8}, {"type": "level", "content": "A1.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Exchange information on instructions about basic activities and safety at work.  "}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  "}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Times and Dates"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the question<span class=\"italic\"> What time is it?</span> to ask for the time now.  You can use <span class=\"italic\">When is the ... ?</span> to ask for the day and date of an activity."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the prepositions <span class=\"strong\">on</span>,<span class=\"strong\"> in</span>, and <span class=\"strong\">at</span> when you talk about the time and the date."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use <span class=\"strong\">on</span> to talk about the date:<span class=\"italic\"> on the 1st, on the 2nd, on the 3rd</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use <span class=\"strong\"> in</span> to talk about the period: <span class=\"italic\">in 15 minutes, in an hour </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use <span class=\"strong\">at</span> to talk about a specific time: <span class=\"italic\">at 9:00 a.m.,at  2:30 p.m.  </span>"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Asking for, Accepting and Declining Help"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you need help, here's how you can ask in a polite way. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "When someone wants to help you, here's how you can accept or say no (decline).  "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Ask for Help</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Accept Offers of Help</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Decline Offers of Help</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Can you ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Thank you. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Thank you, but I'm ok. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Can you help me ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">That's very helpful of you!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I don't need any help, thanks.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Could I ask you to ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Thanks for the offer!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I appreciate the offer, but ... </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ron</span>: Can you help me practice? <br /><span class=\"strong\">Barbara</span>: Sure! Let me give you some advice. <br /><span class=\"strong\">Ron</span>: That's very helpful of you!<br /> <span class=\"strong\">Barbara</span>: Do you want me to write notes?<br /><span class=\"strong\">Ron</span>: I appreciate the offer, but it's okay."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to practice "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to do something again and again to become better at it "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm practicing for my interview."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le08ob05aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use when preparing for an interview."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "volunteer "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "someone who does a job without getting any money "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm a volunteer at the library."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le08ob05aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pointer"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a useful piece of information that helps you  do something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, 